Copyright file from Debian Ghostscript auxiliary fonts package.

I have downloaded the fonts from 
  ftp://mirror.cs.wisc.edu/pub/mirrors/ghost/gnu/fonts/ 
in the file named
  gnu-gs-fonts-other-6.0.tar.gz

